### SCENARIO: Request rejected locally — insufficient balance
### Prerequisites: run 01-seed-balances.http first

### Step 1: Check emp-1 balance (should show ~12 effective vacation days)
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-1/loc-nyc

### Step 2: Try to request 50 days — way more than available
# Expected: 422 INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-1",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-10-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-15",
  "days": 50,
  "idempotencyKey": "insufficient-001"
}
